  "provenance": {
    "type": "spec",
    "note": "The base context is the read context of the request, so each object of the full closure is in the base closure. BUN-DLT-2 gives status ok, no items and a bundle with no descriptor and no payload. BUN-DLT-4 gives ok and no items for the import, and the store content does not change."
